# A read-only, empty date control: its exact type cannot be established by anyone, so a test asserts
# what is actually knowable -- that the control is there, carries the configured caption, and is
# read-only. 'check X exists' compares both the element-name and the caption.

use Supervisor
open UsrTestForm for 71d27c81-3d6b-41d9-9a39-c408c96173b6

click TabContainer_qtw0r0n

check DateTimePicker_q04aqpj exists
check DateTimePicker_q04aqpj is readonly
check DateTimePicker_q04aqpj is not required
